      "seg_id": 16,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Esmolol is kown to reduce the requirement for intravenous anaesthetics and decrease the BIS during surgery.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Therefore, it is probable that continuous infusion of esmolol affects the requirement for inhalation anaesthetics.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "However, few studies have examined this.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Therefore, we examined whether a continuous infusion of low-dose esmolol reduces the requirement for sevoflurane during laparoscopic gynaecologic surgery.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 20,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The treatment group (n = 27) is infused with a loading dose of 0.5 mg/kg esmolol, followed by an infusion of 30 µg/kg/min during surgery.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The control group (n = 27) is infused with the same volume of normal saline.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
